Third-party material included in this repository:

1. ros2/arctos_description
   Taken from ros2_arctos (https://github.com/cr0Kz/ros2_arctos), the official
   ROS 2 package for the Arctos arm, licensed under the Apache License,
   Version 2.0. The license text is kept in ros2/arctos_description/LICENSE.
   Changes made to the copied files are listed in
   ros2/arctos_description/ORIGIN.md.

2. ros2/arctos_description/meshes/*.stl
   Visualisation meshes of the Arctos robot arm, designed by Arctos Robotics
   (https://arctosrobotics.com). They are the files published in ros2_arctos
   under the Apache License 2.0 and are included unchanged. The full CAD
   files that Arctos Robotics sells are not part of this repository.

3. src/arctos/mks.py, docs/can-protocol.md
   Implemented from the publicly available "MKS SERVO42D/57D CAN User Manual"
   by Makerbase (https://github.com/makerbase-motor). No Makerbase code is
   included.
